n/mod.rs` | `libloading` harness — loads **both** `.so`s, `dlsym(\"driver\")`, fd-1 capture to file and to pipe, seeded xorshift RNG, `DRIVER_RUST_SO` override |\n| `tests/differential.rs`, `tests/errors.rs` | 26 + 16 tests, one per `CONFIGS.md` / `ERRORS.md` row |\n| `verify.sh` | builds C + every Rust profile/feature combo, diffs `nm -D`, runs the matrix |\n\nHarness validated as non-vacuous: a 1-bit mutation to `IS_ALPHA` fails 17/26 tests. `c_src/` unmodified apart from the `build/` output dir."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":82500,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":251,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5dbb4c65-24c8-4729-bb23-de499f46374c","uuid":"d26212c1-0dd4-4018-870b-e1213280fde4","timestamp":"2026-09-03T11:26:08.460Z"}
